{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1339","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1339/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1339/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1339/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/1339","id":411135493,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0MTExMzU0OTM=","number":1339,"title":"Crash with callable using static type","user":{"login":"bugreportuser","id":37939393,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTM5Mzkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37939393?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser","html_url":"https://github.com/bugreportuser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bugreportuser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2019-02-17T01:35:14Z","updated_at":"2019-02-17T18:15:09Z","closed_at":"2019-02-17T18:15:09Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Psalm crashes for `callable(static)`, `callable(self)`, and `callable($this)` types.\r\n\r\nExample (https://getpsalm.org/r/bfdf394f45):\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\nclass Clazz {\r\n    /**\r\n     * @param callable(static) $f\r\n     */\r\n    function func (callable $f): void {\r\n        $f($this);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nExample output:\r\n```\r\nPsalm runner output:\r\n\r\nInternal Psalm error on line 962 - Cannot handle static when $static_class is empty\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe problem is that `self::checkFunctionLikeArgumentsMatch` is called with `$function_id` as `null`, so `$f($this)` cannot resolve the type of `$f` to check the argument.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/vimeo/psalm/blob/a428b34a1ae983478217c7209d4948697c0c0d5e/src/Psalm/Internal/Analyzer/Statements/Expression/Call/FunctionCallAnalyzer.php#L331-L341","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1339/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/1339/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}